        "y1": 0.4844827586206897
      },
      "text": "LORD-OF-MISRULE. The person who prcsided orer the Christmas revels, by no means an uuimportant personage in the olden times. He began his rule on Al-hallow eve and con tinued it till Candlemas See a list of expences,   dated in 1552, in Kempe's Manuscripts, pp. 44-54. Tor further information on the subject, see Brand, i. 272 ; Arcl xviii, 313-335 Hawkins' Engl. Dram. iii. 156; Strutt, ii. 200 Lilly's Sixe Court Comedies, Loseley",
      "html": null,
