        "y0": 0.3040229885057472,
        "x1": 0.9220657276995304,
        "y1": 0.3494252873563218
      },
      "text": "LORD-FEST. Excessively lordly. LORDINGS. Sirs masters. (A.-s) Itis often used hy later writers in contempt.",
      "html": null,
