        "y0": 0.603448275862069,
        "x1": 0.8507042253521127,
        "y1": 0.6183908045977011
      },
      "text": "The kyng seld, Take me thy tayle,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4788732394366197,
        "y0": 0.5758620689655173,
        "x1": 0.9201877934272301,
        "y1": 0.6068965517241379
      },
      "text": "LORE. (1) Knowledge ; doctrine advice. ( A.-S) (2) Lost. Still in use in Somerset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5577464788732395,
        "y0": 0.6160919540229884,
        "x1": 0.8469483568075118,
        "y1": 0.6310344827586207
      },
      "text": "For my hors wolde not the fayle,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5596244131455399,
        "y0": 0.628735632183908,
        "x1": 0.7455399061032865,
        "y1": 0.6425287356321839
      },
      "text": "A peny that thou lore.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4788732394366197,
        "y0": 0.6505747126436782,
        "x1": 0.916431924882629,
        "y1": 0.6816091954022988
      },
      "text": "LOREFADYR teacher. Loremastir, Dial. Creat. Moral. p. 243.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
