        "y0": 0.6902298850574712,
        "x1": 0.9173708920187794,
        "y1": 0.7183908045977012
      },
      "text": "Here lorefadyr ys thedevyl. MS. Harl. 1701, f 24, LOREINE. A rcin. Sce Lannfal , 888",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183098591549296,
        "y0": 0.6781609195402298,
        "x1": 0.7511737089201879,
        "y1": 0.6931034482758621
      },
      "text": "Of al men they do most evyl,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5577464788732395,
        "y0": 0.7160919540229884,
        "x1": 0.8338028169014085,
        "y1": 0.7408045977011495
      },
      "text": "Hys loreine lemyd alle with pride, Stede and armure alle was blake",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7427230046948358,
